#: ../../getting_started/first_fit.md:1
msgid "Fit an observed spectrum"
msgstr "拟合一条观测光谱"

#: ../../getting_started/first_fit.md:3
msgid ""
"Assuming that we have an observed spectrum, with its wavelength, "
"normalized flux, and uncertainties, as an array of `wave`, `flux` and "
"`uncertainties`."
msgstr "假设你已经有一条观测光谱，并且它的波长、归一化通量和不确定度分别存放在 `wave`、`flux` 和 `uncertainties` 这几个数组里。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_fit.md:5
msgid "They can be inserted into the SME structure with:"
msgstr "这些数据可以这样写入 SME 结构："

#: ../../getting_started/first_fit.md:18
msgid ""
"The new inputs are the [instrument resolution](../concepts/sme_struct.md"
"#instrument-parameters) and [observed "
"spectra](../concepts/sme_struct.md#spectra)."
msgstr ""
"这里新增的关键输入是[仪器分辨率](../concepts/sme_struct.md#instrument-parameters)和"
"[观测光谱](../concepts/sme_struct.md#spectra)。"

#: ../../getting_started/first_fit.md:20
msgid "Then the `solve` function can be used to find the best fit solution:"
msgstr "接着可以调用 `solve` 来寻找最佳拟合解："

#: ../../getting_started/first_fit.md:27
msgid ""
"The [fitresults](../concepts/sme_struct.md#fitresults) are stored in "
"`sme.fitresults`."
msgstr "拟合结果会保存在 `sme.fitresults` 中。相关结构细节可见 [fitresults](../concepts/sme_struct.md#fitresults)。"
